--From 784c7815ff7180850c2b90dd90610828be34aeb8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
--From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
--Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 06:29:39 +0000
--Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): visual overhaul phase 2 for world visuals, feedback
-- and remaining screens
--
--World and feedback:
--- Loot nodes: a sand mound with a glinting edge, a gem and sparkles instead
--  of a neon ball. Every node looks the same, so nothing leaks about the
--  server-side roll.
--- Sonar: expanding pulse, rarity-chip markers, and pinged nodes' sparkles
--  burst in the revealed rarity colour (client-only).
--- FXController (client-only): dock relics bob and spin, with rarity glow
--  rings, sparkles for Legendary+ and a light pillar for Mythic+. Capped at
--  60 stands within 110 studs, 30 Hz.
--- CoinBurst remote: floating "+amount" pop-up and coins flying into the
--  HUD coin badge on collect, sell, sell-commons and offline claim.
--
--Screens:
--- Quests: login calendar reward tiles, quest cards with progress bars and
--  reward pills.
--- Tide Pass: horizontal free/premium reward track that scrolls to the
--  current tier. TierReward moved to shared Formulas so previews match grants.
--- Rebirth: NOW -> AFTER cards, requirement progress, keep/reset summary,
--  talent cards with pips.
--- Leaderboards: board tabs, top-3 podium, ranked rows.
--- Players: avatar headshots. Trade: offers as relic cards with ready
--  states, card-grid storage picker.
--- Popups: backdrop, hero icon badge and accent glow for offers, confirm,
--  death, robbed and offline screens.
--
--Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
--Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FawWwJeiZra1BJ6euR1d3g
-----
